<title>JAPAN: Showa Shell - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Showa Shell - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.60 trln	 vs	    1.44 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   20.70		vs	   28.84</p>
<p> Current	     15.23		vs	   21.99</p>
<p> Net		    6.05		vs	   13.80</p>
<p> EPS		   16.06 yen	  vs	   39.94 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Showa Shell Sekiyu KK is an oil refiner and distributor.</p>
